    "RowId": 37594,
    "Description": "Attracts fish with large jaws and increases your chances of landing one. Occasionally guarantees you will land a large-jawed fish.\nCan be used up to 3 times while fishing, each use increasing the effectiveness and GP cost.\nMay also attract rare species of fish. Effective on fish caught using <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Powerful Hookset</span>.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">First Use: </span>10 GP\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Second Use: </span>20 GP\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Third Use: </span>30 GP"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1711526,
    "RowId": 37595,
    "Description": "Attracts fish with small jaws and increases your chances of landing one. Occasionally guarantees you will land a small-jawed fish.\nCan be used up to 3 times while fishing, each use increasing the effectiveness and GP cost.\nMay also attract rare species of fish. Effective on fish caught using <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Precision Hookset</span>.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">First Use: </span>10 GP\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Second Use: </span>20 GP\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Third Use: </span>30 GP"
